June 8: $68,000 to Nova Equipment Partners LLC in California.
June 25: $82,500 to Eastern Bridge Components Ltd. in Singapore.
July 3: $64,000 to Cascade Procurement Services LLC in Oregon.
July 29: $79,000 to Pacific Meridian Trading Ltd. in Hong Kong.
